246
00:15:31,563 --> 00:15:34,523
No, I don't want anything,
but thank you. What?

247
00:15:35,663 --> 00:15:36,523
I see.

248
00:15:37,443 --> 00:15:41,403
So you have no need for money
nor land, do you? Fair enough.

249
00:15:41,683 --> 00:15:44,095
How about the treasures from the dungeon?

250
00:15:44,243 --> 00:15:48,583
Our country takes great pride in
possessing the world's oldest dungeon.

251
00:15:49,043 --> 00:15:53,925
All manner of rarities have been unearthed
and are stored within the treasure hall.

252
00:15:54,523 --> 00:15:58,640
You can walk through our collection of
priceless relics and take whatever you like.

253
00:15:58,723 --> 00:16:00,660
That is far too generous, Father.

254
00:16:00,743 --> 00:16:02,625
I don't want any of that either.

255
00:16:03,763 --> 00:16:06,900
I mean, I don't need any sort
of gifts at all, Your Grace.

256
00:16:06,983 --> 00:16:09,924
What you have already
granted is more than enough.

257
00:16:10,403 --> 00:16:12,823
So, no treasures either.

258
00:16:14,163 --> 00:16:16,023
Let's see then, what can we do?

259
00:16:16,623 --> 00:16:18,363
I gotta get out of here.

260
00:16:26,003 --> 00:16:27,043
Here we go.

261
00:16:28,463 --> 00:16:30,203
What do you think of this?

262
00:16:31,263 --> 00:16:34,123
Is that a sword? Weird.

263
00:16:34,603 --> 00:16:35,883
A sword it is.

264
00:16:36,123 --> 00:16:39,005
I know it doesn't look
like much at first glance.

265
00:16:39,663 --> 00:16:40,540
Father, what are you doing?

266
00:16:40,623 --> 00:16:42,543
It's fine, Rain. Please.

267
00:16:42,923 --> 00:16:47,380
At this point, I'm afraid it has become
nothing more than a mere decoration.

268
00:16:47,463 --> 00:16:50,757
This is far better than just
letting it sit here unused.

269
00:16:50,883 --> 00:16:51,824
Yes, but Father!

270
00:16:52,083 --> 00:16:53,203
Oh, relax.

271
00:16:53,823 --> 00:16:57,294
No one will even notice if I
switch it out for the replica.

272
00:16:59,643 --> 00:17:00,483
Take it.

273
00:17:07,463 --> 00:17:09,343
Dang, it's super heavy.

274
00:17:11,963 --> 00:17:14,840
I'm sure this must be a
family heirloom or something.

275
00:17:14,923 --> 00:17:16,982
I could never accept this from you.

276
00:17:17,203 --> 00:17:18,123
Oh, no, no.

277
00:17:18,383 --> 00:17:20,760
I simply stumbled upon
it while on a journey.

278
00:17:20,843 --> 00:17:22,490
I don't even remember where.

279
00:17:23,043 --> 00:17:24,503
He just found it?

280
00:17:24,723 --> 00:17:26,488
It's basically a hand-me-down.

281
00:17:26,763 --> 00:17:28,340
Will you at least accept that?

282
00:17:28,423 --> 00:17:30,070
It will make me feel better.

283
00:17:31,163 --> 00:17:32,987
Of course, I graciously accept.

284
00:17:34,403 --> 00:17:35,233
Good.

285
00:17:35,316 --> 00:17:37,900
Would you like to give
it a nice, solid swing?

286
00:17:37,983 --> 00:17:38,813
Oh, okay.

287
00:17:39,763 --> 00:17:41,057
Physical enhancements.

288
00:17:42,683 --> 00:17:43,513
How's this?

289
00:17:52,723 --> 00:17:56,283
It is heavy, but not so
much that I can't swing it.

290
00:17:58,103 --> 00:17:58,943
Look at that.

291
00:17:59,143 --> 00:18:00,790
You can wield it one-handed.

292
00:18:01,043 --> 00:18:03,278
Aren't you a strong, sturdy young man?

293
00:18:03,703 --> 00:18:05,543
That is very kind of you, sire.

294
00:18:06,083 --> 00:18:07,843
Also, about my daughter.

295
00:18:08,763 --> 00:18:11,780
I would like you to teach her some
things, toughen her up a little.

296
00:18:11,863 --> 00:18:14,640
Things are getting perilous out there.

297
00:18:14,723 --> 00:18:16,080
I'm rather worried about her.

298
00:18:16,163 --> 00:18:17,480
You want me to?

299
00:18:17,563 --> 00:18:18,560
Gosh, no.

300
00:18:18,643 --> 00:18:21,320
There's nothing I can
teach her and anyway,

301
00:18:21,403 --> 00:18:23,540
it's something she should
you know decide on her own.

302
00:18:23,623 --> 00:18:25,540
When parents meddle too much,

303
00:18:25,623 --> 00:18:27,960
their kids kind of tend to
head in the opposite direction.

304
00:18:28,043 --> 00:18:29,120
Yes, indeed.

305
00:18:29,203 --> 00:18:30,556
I suppose you're right.

306
00:18:32,663 --> 00:18:34,443
He sure does laugh a lot.

307
00:18:35,103 --> 00:18:36,923
Well, I better hit the road.

308
00:18:37,663 --> 00:18:38,493
Right.

309
00:18:38,576 --> 00:18:40,164
I appreciate your time, good sir.

310
00:18:40,283 --> 00:18:43,283
And as Lin's father, I
humbly thank you once again.

311
00:18:45,743 --> 00:18:47,760
The heft would be great for training,

312
00:18:47,843 --> 00:18:52,123
but I kind of feel like I
was given something valuable.

313
00:18:54,643 --> 00:18:57,083
Ah. Wait a sec. This sword.

314
00:18:57,903 --> 00:19:01,668
It's about the same width as the
drain by Auntie Stella's house.

315
00:19:03,363 --> 00:19:06,775
This will be great for dredging
the muck out of the sewer.

316
00:19:07,003 --> 00:19:10,223
I'll try it first thing
tomorrow. Sir! Huh?

317
00:19:11,083 --> 00:19:12,203
We must talk.

318
00:19:12,603 --> 00:19:14,820
Don't worry, I won't take
much more of your time.

319
00:19:14,903 --> 00:19:15,733
Oh, crap.

320
00:19:15,923 --> 00:19:17,041
What does she want?

321
00:19:19,203 --> 00:19:22,200
First of all, I'd like to
apologize for my behavior.

322
00:19:22,283 --> 00:19:24,360
My conduct was not appropriate towards the

323
00:19:24,443 --> 00:19:27,000
very person who saved
Lady Lindbergh's life.

324
00:19:27,083 --> 00:19:29,360
I would like to ask you
for your forgiveness.

325
00:19:29,443 --> 00:19:30,303
Oh, uh, no.

326
00:19:30,583 --> 00:19:31,600
We don't need to do that.

327
00:19:31,683 --> 00:19:33,920
And please, you should stand up, really.

328
00:19:34,003 --> 00:19:36,062
Thank you for accepting my apology.

329
00:19:36,463 --> 00:19:39,040
It is my sworn duty to
protect the people of the

330
00:19:39,123 --> 00:19:41,660
Clays family from all
dangers they may encounter.

331
00:19:41,743 --> 00:19:43,780
And you should understand that said duty

332
00:19:43,863 --> 00:19:46,480
always takes precedence
over how I treat guests.

333
00:19:46,563 --> 00:19:47,393
Okay.

334
00:19:47,476 --> 00:19:50,109
So you are not Lin's
maid, after all, are you?

335
00:19:52,203 --> 00:19:53,343
No, I'm not.

336
00:19:53,603 --> 00:19:55,015
Let me introduce myself.

337
00:19:56,543 --> 00:20:00,923
I am Ines Harness, a member of the
Warrior Corps for the Claes family.

338
00:20:01,203 --> 00:20:02,615
I serve as Vice Captain.

339
00:20:02,983 --> 00:20:04,689
Sounds like she's a big shot.

340
00:20:05,463 --> 00:20:07,383
From very early in my childhood,

341
00:20:07,603 --> 00:20:09,780
I have been known as the Divine Shield,

342
00:20:09,863 --> 00:20:14,098
as I was appointed as the personal
royal guard of Lady Lindbergh's life.

343
00:20:14,623 --> 00:20:18,660
Of course, that means I am the one
who must protect my lady at all costs,

344
00:20:18,743 --> 00:20:20,625
even if it forfeits my own life.

345
00:20:21,123 --> 00:20:23,580
And since you are the
person who saved her life,

346
00:20:23,663 --> 00:20:26,120
It is as though you saved my life as well.

347
00:20:26,203 --> 00:20:28,321
I didn't do anything all that major.

348
00:20:28,483 --> 00:20:29,313
I mean it.

349
00:20:29,396 --> 00:20:31,880
From here on, I shall help
you in every way possible.

350
00:20:31,963 --> 00:20:35,081
If you need my assistance
with anything, let me know.

351
00:20:35,703 --> 00:20:37,943
These people are really overdoing it.

352
00:20:38,263 --> 00:20:40,969
Jeez, it's all a bit too
much for me, I swear.

353
00:20:41,743 --> 00:20:44,037
If anything comes up, I'll ask for you.

354
00:20:44,683 --> 00:20:46,583
But let me warn you.

355
00:20:47,183 --> 00:20:52,083
Lady Lindbergh may have allowed your
attitude, demeanor, your speech and behavior,

356
00:20:52,683 --> 00:20:55,560
All unpardonable while in
audience with the king.

357
00:20:55,643 --> 00:20:58,937
You are not permitted to take
on such a familiar manner.

358
00:20:59,643 --> 00:21:00,473
That said,

359
00:21:00,563 --> 00:21:05,200
should you continue as such, I will no
longer be able to overlook your disrespect.

360
00:21:05,283 --> 00:21:08,640
Get yourself together, especially
in front of the retainers.

361
00:21:08,723 --> 00:21:09,553
Right.

362
00:21:09,663 --> 00:21:11,663
And I do appreciate the warning.

363
00:21:13,523 --> 00:21:14,353
Okay.

364
00:21:14,436 --> 00:21:17,219
Well, that's all I really
wanted to talk to you about.

365
00:21:17,723 --> 00:21:21,340
Now then, to whom is it that I
find myself so deeply indebted?

366
00:21:21,423 --> 00:21:24,364
I would like to have your
name, if you don't mind.

367
00:21:24,683 --> 00:21:25,583
I'm Noor.

368
00:21:26,843 --> 00:21:27,673
Noor!

369
00:21:28,163 --> 00:21:30,222
Oh, did I do something wrong again?

370
00:21:30,383 --> 00:21:32,963
No, I'm sorry. It's nothing.

371
00:21:34,283 --> 00:21:37,563
Pardon, I must be taking my leave. Sure.

372
00:21:39,783 --> 00:21:41,903
Great, I ticked her off again.

373
00:21:42,823 --> 00:21:45,903
Is our illustrious hero
already heading home?

374
00:21:46,103 --> 00:21:48,420
Oh, that's... he's...

375
00:21:48,503 --> 00:21:50,003
he's that guy.

376
00:21:50,263 --> 00:21:51,093
I should know this.

377
00:21:51,176 --> 00:21:52,200
You may have heard of me.

378
00:21:52,283 --> 00:21:53,113
I'm Gilbert.

379
00:21:53,243 --> 00:21:55,067
Won't you join me for a moment?

380
00:21:55,643 --> 00:21:59,231
I would like you to show me
these wonderful talents of yours.

381
00:22:01,803 --> 00:22:03,483
I just want to go home.
